  <section class="about-copy">

    <p>
      I’m a wife, mom of two, cat servant, and freelance writer.
    </p>

    <p>
      I started this site as a home for the stories, reflections, and 3 a.m. thoughts
      that don’t always fit neatly into a social media post. Some are about family and
      parenting. Others wander into books, faith, school, growing older, memories, and
      trying to make sense of the world around us.
    </p>

    <p>
      When I’m not working on a writing project or attending school activities, you’ll
      probably find me spending time with my family, reading a book, or being supervised
      by an unreasonable number of cats.
    </p>

    <p>
      Mostly, this is just a collection of stories and observations from a mom who’s
      learning as she goes, overthinking more than necessary, and writing about it along
      the way.
    </p>

    <p class="closing">
      Thanks for stopping by. I hope you find something here that makes you smile,
      think, remember, or feel a little less alone.
